   "template": true,
   "raw": "Page 1\nRU60_V.2.3\nCPU\nMediaTek MT7981\nRAM\n1GB\nFLASH\n128MB NAND\nWAN\n1x 10/100/1000 (Active POE)\nLAN\n1x 10/100/1000\nWi-Fi\n802.11 b/g/n/ac/ax\nRTC\nBuilt-in RTC\nReset\nPinhole Reset Button\nAntenna\nWi-Fi: 5x Internal Antenna\nStatus LED\n1x Power, 1x Wi-Fi 5G, 1x Wi-Fi 2G, 1x PRG, 2x Ethernet\nPower Connector\nDC Jack\nInput Voltage Range\n12 Vdc\nPower Adapter\nYES\nEnclosure\nPlastic\nMounting\nCeiling Mount\nDesign\nFanless\nDimensions\n190mm x 190mm x 40mm(W x D x H)\nWeight\n250 gm\nOther\nGrounding Screw\nRU60\nDATA SHEET\nPRODUCT INFO\nPROCESSOR\nMediaTek MT7981,1GB DDR4 RAM, 128 Mb NAND\nCELLULAR\nNA\nWi-Fi\nDual-Band Wi-Fi, AP/Station, External 5dBi antennas\nINTERFACE\n1x LAN 10/100/1000, 1x WAN 10/100/1000\nPOWER\n12V DC IN\nOPERATING SYSTEM\nOpen-WRT Linux\nHardware Specification\nPage 2\nRU60_V.2.3\nSOFTWARE SPECIFICATIONS\nStorage Temperature\n-20 ~ 60 °C\nOperating Temperature\n0~ 50 °C\nHumidity\n10 ~ 90% (non-condensing)\nTechnology\n802.11 b/g/n/ac/ax\nChannel Selector\nAuto/Configurable\nChannel Width\n20 MHz, 20/40/80/160 MHz\nWi-Fi Mode\nAccess Point (AP), Station, AP & Client, Guest Wi-Fi, Mesh Wi-Fi\nTX Power\nConfigurable\nAuthentication\nWPA (PSK), WPA2 (PSK), WPA3 (PSK), WPA & WPA2 Mixed Mode, WPA2 &\nWPA3 Mixed Mode\nEncryption\nTKIP, AES, TKIP & AES\nWi-Fi Scheduler\nScheduled ON/OFF\nMAC ID Filtering\nWhitelisting, Blacklisting\nOther\nWMM (Enabled/Disabled)\nRouting\nStatic routing, Advanced Static Routing\nNetwork Protocols\nTCP, UDP, IPv4, IPv6, ICMP, NTP, HTTP, HTTPS, SCP, PPP, SSH, DHCP\nConnection Monitoring\nPing Reboot, Scheduled Periodic Reboot, Hardware Watchdog (Enable /\nDisable)\nFirewall features\nPort forward, traffic rules, SNAT, Zone forwarding, Parental Control,\nMasquerading, MSS Clamping, Loopback IP, Loopback Rules.\nAttack Prevention\nSYN Flood Protection, Drop Invalid Packets\nDHCP\nStatic and Dynamic\nMulti-WAN Configuration\nConfigurable Failover, load balancing between Wi-Fi WAN and Wired.\nVLAN\nTagged VLAN, Untagged VLAN\nVPN\nOpen VPN, IPsec, GRE, L2TP, PPTP, Wireguard, Zero Tier, IPIP Tunnel\nOpen VPN\nTUN/TAP with TLS Certificates\nIPsec\nIKEv1, IKEv2, Aggressive/Main Mode\nIPsec Encryption\n3DES, AES128, AES192, AES256\nIPsec Authentication\nSHA1, MD5, SHA256, SHA384, SHA512\nIPsec DH Group\nMODP768, MODP1024, MODP1536, MODP2048, MODP3072, MODP4096\nPPTP/L2TP\nServer & Client with/without MPPE Encryption\nMonitoring Application\nRouter Monitoring with ICMP Echo\nTime Synchronization\nNTP Client, RTC, Manual\nDiagnostic\nPing, Traceroute, Modem Debug Info, Iperf, Download Logs\nOther Features\nMAC binding, Connection Diagnostics, URL Filtering, Router Health\nMonitoring, Package Manager\nNMS\nRemote Monitoring & Management Platform for SILBO Networking products\nNMS VPN\nRemote Access of SILBO and non-SILBO Networking Device\nTR069\nTR069 Client for CPE Management\nOperational & Environmental\nFirewall & Networking\nWi-Fi\nRemote Management\nPage 3\nRU60_V.2.3\n*All rights reserved, subject to change without prior notice.\nOperating System\nOpen-WRT based Linux OS\nSupported Languages\nShell scripting, C, C++\nDevelopment tools\nSDK package with built environment provided (Optional)\nRU60 Router with Plastic housing, Power Adapter, 01-meter Ethernet cable.\nGet in touch:\nsales@invendis.com\nwww.silbonetworks.com\nInvendis Technologies India Private Limited\nNo. 230, 1st Cross, 38th Main, BOOHBCS Layout, BTM\n2nd Stage, Bangalore – 560 068\nStandard Packaging\nOperating System"
