   "values": {
    "website": "A compact, fanless Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) access point and router built on MediaTek MT7981 with OpenWRT. Supports AP, Station, Repeater, Guest Wi-Fi, and EasyMesh modes with 1 LAN + 1 WAN Gigabit port. Designed for indoor enterprise, retail, and industrial environments requiring reliable, high-throughput wireless connectivity.",
    "catalogue": "A compact, fanless Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) access point and router built on MediaTek MT7981 with OpenWRT. Supports AP, Station, Repeater, Guest Wi-Fi, and EasyMesh modes with 1 LAN + 1 WAN Gigabit port. Designed for indoor enterprise, retail, and industrial environments requiring reliable, high-throughput wireless connectivity."
